---
layout: base.njk
title: About
permalink: /about/
description: "DC Social Collective is a young adult events company and a community that brings about 6,000 people a year out across DC, Maryland, and Virginia. Here is how it started and what to expect."
---
<div class="wrap page-head">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ about.lede }}</p>
</div>
<section class="band" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="wrap two-col" style="align-items:stretch">
    <div class="prose">
      {%- for p in about.pillars %}
      <h2>{{ p.heading }}</h2>
      <p>{{ p.text }}</p>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <img class="fill" src="/images/gallery/08.jpg" alt="A group photo at a country night" loading="lazy" width="2500" height="1667">
  </div>
</section>
<section class="band paper">
  <div class="wrap two-col" style="align-items:start">
    <div>
    <h2>Our story</h2>
    <div class="letter">
      <p>{{ about.letter.greeting }}</p>
      {{ about.letter.body | md | safe }}
      <p>{{ about.letter.closing | replace("send them our way.", "send them our way at <a href=\"mailto:" + site.email + "\">" + site.email + "</a>.") | safe }}</p>
      <div class="signature">
        <img src="/images/team/christopher-byrne.jpg" alt="Christopher Byrne" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy">
        <p>{{ about.letter.signoff }}<br><strong>{{ about.letter.name }}</strong><br>{{ about.letter.role }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
    <div class="story-side">
      <img src="/images/gallery/05.jpg" alt="A room full of young adults at a winery night" loading="lazy" width="2500" height="1666">
      <p>{{ about.sideCaption | safe }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="band navy on-dark" id="watch">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>Watch</h2></div>
    <div class="videos">
    {%- for v in videos %}
      <figure>
        <video controls preload="none" poster="/video/{{ v.slug }}.jpg" width="1280" height="720"><source src="/video/{{ v.slug }}.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
        <figcaption><strong>{{ v.title }}</strong><br>{{ v.where }}. Video by {{ v.credit }}.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="band" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Questions people ask</h2>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>What is DC Social Collective?</summary><p>A young adult events company and a community that brings about 6,000 people a year out across DC, Maryland, and Virginia. We plan and run nights out that bring people together to dance, meet, and celebrate.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How old is the crowd?</summary><p>Mostly twenties to early thirties. Events are built primarily for young adults 18 to 35.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is it only parties?</summary><p>No. We run formal galas, rooftop soirees, fundraisers, live music nights, and seasonal farm dances. The point is community, and dancing turns out to be a good way to get there.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is this a singles group?</summary><p>No. Events are for everyone: singles, couples, and anyone in between. More than a few couples have met at DSC and gone on to get married, but there's no pressure.</p></details>
      <details><summary>I've never danced. Will I be lost?</summary><p>Dance nights start with a beginner lesson, usually 45 minutes, taught for people who have never done it. Most of the room learned that way.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
